    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Sheehy Meares Real Estate are delighted to present this excellent partially completed property in Milltown, Co. Galway, H54 W5Y2. Offering approximately 2,100 sq. ft. of accommodation, the property has been block-built, with the roof, windows and external doors already in place. The interior remains unfinished, providing the new owner with a fantastic opportunity to complete the property to their own taste and specifications.\n\nThe proposed accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, generous open-plan kitchen/dining and living area, four bedrooms including a master bedroom with ensuite, family bathroom and utility room. A standout feature of the design is the mezzanine level above the main living area, which offers exceptional versatility and can be used as a home office, music room or additional TV/lounge space. This area may be left open to enhance the sense of space and light, or alternatively enclosed for greater privacy, making it a highly valuable and flexible addition to the home.\n\nThe spacious layout offers excellent potential for a modern family home with well-proportioned living and bedroom accommodation throughout\n\nThe property is accompanied by an impressive A0 provisional BER rating and has been designed to incorporate underfloor heating throughout. There is also the option to install a wood pellet stove within the main open-plan living area, providing an additional heating option and focal point for the room. Further energy-efficient features include triple-glazed windows throughout.\n\nExternally, the property will provide ample off-street parking, landscaped gardens and the added benefit of a garage, offering excellent additional storage space.\nThis family home is ideally situated in the heart of Milltown, a thriving and welcoming village offering an excellent quality of life and a strong sense of community. The property is conveniently located just 10 minutes from Tuam, with easy access to the M17 motorway, approximately 35 minutes from Galway City, and within easy reach of Claremorris, Castlebar and Roscommon.\n\nMilltown offers a superb range of local amenities, with Milltown GAA grounds located directly across the road and Milltown and Belmont National Schools both just minutes drive away. The village also boasts a selection of shops, pubs, restaurants, playgrounds and the popular Milltown Heritage Park. Excellent public transport links are available, with both Burkes Bus and Bus Éireann providing services to Galway City and Ballina.\n\nA multi-time winner of the prestigious ?Best Kept Village? accolade, Milltown is renowned for its picturesque surroundings, vibrant community spirit and excellent range of amenities.\n\nThis property represents a fantastic opportunity to acquire a distinctive and spacious family home, combining the tranquillity and charm of village and countryside living with excellent access to major commuting routes and surrounding towns and cities.\n\nPlease note that some images are AI generated for marketing purposes\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Wonderfully Located\nSpacious detached residence\nIn the heart of Milltown Village\n35 minutes from Galway City\nBlank canvas to style your own property\nWater and sewer connected\nESB connection granted\n\n"
      },
